      "id": "claim_5631322376594f32816b1b58da13c2b9",
      "statement": "The `describe_slides` stage uses the `openrouter` vision backend exclusively and issues one OpenRouter vision call per slide, with the descriptor being image-only and never receiving the transcript.",
